"The personal options relate to your personal identity, and other "
"miscellaneous things that do not fall under any of the other general "
"categories."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:2429
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use email settings from System Settings"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2430
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check this box to use your name and email address as set in &systemsettings; "
"(<menuchoice><guimenuitem>Account Details</guimenuitem> "
"<guimenuitem>Password &amp; User Account</guimenuitem></menuchoice>)."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:2437
#, no-c-format
msgid "Full name"
