#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:2562
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Additionally, you have check boxes labeled after the days of the week. Check "
"the week days that are working days for you, in order to mark the working "
"hours in these days. Check <guilabel>Exclude holidays</guilabel> prevent "
"&korganizer; from marking the working hours for the holiday region defined "
"in the <guilabel>Use holiday region</guilabel> drop down above."
msgstr ""

