#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the <guilabel>Show events that recur daily</guilabel> in date navigator "
"box is checked, the days containing daily recurring events are shown in bold "
"typeface in the date navigator."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:2651
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show events that recur weekly"
