#: index.docbook:2652
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the <guilabel>Show events that recur weekly</guilabel> in date navigator "
"box is checked, the days containing weekly recurring events are shown in "
"bold typeface in the date navigator."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:2658
#, no-c-format
msgid "Week numbers select a work week when in work week mode"
