#: index.docbook:2701
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"With &korganizer;, you can <link linkend=\"config-main-colors\">assign a "
"different color to each resource</link>. This check box toggles the use the "
"resource color when displaying the to-do or event in the agenda view on and "
"off. Note that if you do not assign different colors, there is little sense "
"in using this feature, as &korganizer; default configuration is to use the "
"same color for all resources."
